<title>CANADA: Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</title>
<headline>Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Wheat Board  reported seven ships loading, 11 waiting and four due at the Canadian West Coast as of Wednesday.</p>
<p>The longest wait to load on the West Coast was 11 days. Three ship loaded in Thunder Bay and eight were due. Three ships loaded on the East Coast, four waited to load, nine due.</p>
<p>    Port	 Loading	Waiting</p>
<p>    Vancouver	 6	     9</p>
<p>    Prince Rupert   1	     3</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204-947-3548))</p>
</text>
